          "code": "<!-- Clean Production Pattern -->\n<div class=\"card\">\n  <!-- HTML Inputs: type=\"number\" & type=\"range\" -->\n  <p>Always write clean, semantic markup.</p>\n</div>",
          "caption": "Production-ready clean HTML pattern."
