        "heading": "2. How It Works (Step-by-Step)",
        "content": "### Step-by-Step Breakdown\nThe <link> element provides standardized semantic markup for web documents.\n\n#### Why Web Developers Use This:\n- **Clean Code**: Produces standard-compliant markup readable by humans and search engines.\n- **Universal Compatibility**: Supported across all browsers on desktop, iOS, and Android without plugins.\n- **Better Performance**: Lightweight native HTML features load instantly without heavy JavaScript libraries.",
