        "heading": "1. What is The <abbr> Element?",
        "content": "### What is this?\nThe <abbr> element is an official HTML element belonging to the Inline text semantics category. Represents an abbreviation or acronym.\n\n### Key Features & Benefits\n- **Part**: Part of the official WHATWG HTML Living Standard and MDN specification.\n- **Categorized**: Categorized under Inline text semantics.\n- **Semantic**: Semantic element mapped directly into the browser DOM and Accessibility Tree.\n- **Fully**: Fully supported across all modern web browsers (Chrome, Edge, Safari, Firefox).",
